WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
[A man calls out at a woman, again and again, over a heartbeat. Then silence.]

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.708
For you, that was a simulation. For many women, it’s an ordinary walk home.

3
00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:15.311
66% of women in the United States have been sexually harassed in a public space, the most frequently reported location. (Source: Stop Street Harassment, 2018)

4
00:00:15.331 --> 00:00:20.580
44% of women surveyed by YouGov say they regularly hold keys or another item as improvised self-defence, compared with 11% of men. (Source: YouGov, 2022)

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.739
Only 25% of people who experienced sexual harassment in public spaces say someone helped them. (Source: L'Oreal Paris, 2020)

6
00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:28.949
But sometimes, there is someone to help.

7
00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:32.138
And this time, it’s you.

8
00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:36.417
What are you going to do?
